main/docs/cla/cla%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#faq). \n\nAfter signing the CLA or updating the email, you must comment `/check-cla` to check the CLA status again.","created_at":"2026-03-14T12:51:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T19:38:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165258722,"discussion_id":"984ba29676b57fc423e5d52812f6b1ac83fe60b6","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-14T12:51:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-14T12:51:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165258740,"discussion_id":"7e45feb05867745e8253a365da81e994ec4df3ff","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复RMSNorm算子分片计算中基础维度计算逻辑错误。原逻辑在处理非标准形状的Gamma参数时，错误地将输入张量的最后一个维度作为列数，并据此计算行数，导致分片计算的基础数据维度与参数形状不匹配，可能引发后续计算异常。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n重构了`NormCommonTiling`函数中`numRow`和`numCol`的计算逻辑。新方案通过计算输入张量的总元素数除以Gamma参数张量的总元素数（`gamma_size`）来得到`numRow`，并将`numCol`直接设置为`gamma_size`。此修改确保了分片计算的基础维度与参数形状严格对应，保证了计算逻辑的正确性。","created_at":"2026-03-14T12:51:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-14T12:51:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165